# Provenance & Reference Specification: Banking Management System
- **Domain**: Banking / FinTech / Core Financial Services
- **Source Specification**: specification.docx (core banking requirements specification covering KYC, accounts, fund transfers, tellers, loans, AML compliance)
- **Authoring Methodology**: Standard enterprise banking functional decomposition.
- **Reference Independence**: Authored independently prior to running the pipeline.
- **Limitations & Ambiguities**: Loan application workflows span both document verification (FILE) and approval workflows (BOOKING/SCHEDULING).
